# MANIFEST.sha256 — SHA-256 checksums of the licensed More Than A Hack 2027 match assets.
#
# THE MATCH DATA IS NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY AND MUST NEVER BE COMMITTED.
#
# The competition data (Metrica Sports tracking, Smart Tagging and homography for the
# Barcelona v Athletic Club fixture) is licensed to the teams that download it. It may not
# be redistributed, so this repository ships the *checksums* instead of the data: a
# reviewer who has their own copy can prove it is byte-for-byte the data we used.
#
# The paths below are relative to the DATA DIRECTORY (the repository's ./data/), so the
# manifest is checked from there:
#
#     cd data
#     shasum -a 256 -c ../MANIFEST.sha256
#
# (equivalently, with this manifest copied next to the assets, `shasum -a 256 -c
# MANIFEST.sha256` from inside the data directory).
#
# Expected output: one "OK" line per file, and nothing else.
#
# Where the files go once the bundle is unpacked:
#
#     data/tactical/BAR-ATH_tactical_atd.txt            the raw tracking (187 MB)
#     data/tactical/BAR-ATH_tactical_atd.xml            teams and track slots
#     data/tactical/BAR-ATH_tactical_homography.csv      per-frame homography
#     data/tactical/BAR-ATH_tactical_smart_tagging.xml   set-piece windows
#     data/broadcast/BAR-ATH_broadcast_atd.txt           the broadcast tracking
#     data/broadcast/BAR-ATH_broadcast_atd.xml           teams and track slots
#     data/broadcast/BAR-ATH_broadcast_homography.csv     per-frame homography
#
